	"title"		"PlayerQoL"
	"description"		"A comprehensive client-side mod for Puck that enhances chat, player management, and position-based settings!

[h1]Version 2.7.1 - Hub Mod UI Update[/h1]

[h2]Major Performance Improvements[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Event-Driven Architecture[/b] - Replaced constant polling with game event hooks
[*][b]Optimized UI Checks[/b] - Removed expensive per-frame UI queries
[*][b]Reduced CPU Usage[/b] - Significantly lower overhead when mod is running
[/list]

[h2]Position-Based Settings[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Per-Position Overrides[/b] - Customize settings for each position (LW, C, RW, LD, RD, G)
[*][b]FOV[/b] - Different field of view per position
[*][b]Camera Angle[/b] - Adjust camera angle for each role
[*][b]Sensitivity[/b] - Stick and look sensitivity per position
[*][b]Handedness[/b] - Left/right hand preference per position
[*][b]Chat Settings[/b] - Opacity and scale per position
[*][b]Minimap Settings[/b] - Opacity, position, and scale per position
[*][b]Auto-Restore[/b] - Settings automatically restore when changing positions
[/list]

[h1]Features[/h1]

[h2]Chat Enhancements[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]@Mentions[/b] - Tag players with @PlayerName for highlights (@everyone supported)
[*][b]Ping Sounds[/b] - Customizable notification sounds when mentioned
[*][b]Kaomojis[/b] - Auto-convert emoticons (:sob: → (ಥ﹏ಥ) :smile: → (◕‿◕) :shrug: → ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯)
[*][b]Rich Text[/b] - Full rich text support in chat, name tags, and notes
[/list]

[h2]Scoreboard Overhaul[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Right-Click Actions[/b] - Access all player actions via scoreboard
[*][b]Local Mutes & Blocking[/b] - Client-side text/voice muting with permanent block list
[*][b]Individual Volume[/b] - Adjust each player's voice from 0% to 200%
[*][b]Player Info Panels[/b] - Detailed profiles with Steam links, last server, and notes
[/list]

[h2]Player Management[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Player Logging[/b] - Auto-tracks Recent 50 players with full history
[*][b]Custom Notes[/b] - Rich text notes for each player
[*][b]Saved Players[/b] - Favorite teammates with persistent voice settings
[*][b]Blocked Players[/b] - Permanent block list for toxic players
[/list]

[h2]Admin Tools[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Admin QoL Menu[/b] - Comprehensive right-click admin menu on scoreboard
[*][b]Kick Confirmations[/b] - Dual-option confirmations (by number OR name)
[*][b]Full Admin Suite[/b] - Ban, Kick, Mute, Freeze, Swap, Change Team, Info
[*][b]Copy Steam ID[/b] - Instant Steam ID copy on all dialogs
[/list]
[i]Note: Requires MuteMod for most admin features[/i]

[h2]Quality of Life[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Anti-Lag Settings[/b] - Disable ponce arena visuals for better FPS
[*][b]Server Queue System[/b] - Auto-queue when server is full with background queuing
[*][b]Easy-to-Use Menu[/b] - Intuitive tab-based UI (Positions, Commands, Players, Settings)
[*][b]Command Prefills[/b] - Pre-fill any command for quick access
[/list]

	Support me here if you want!
https://buymeacoffee.com/amikiir"
